{"seq":2,"slug":"numbered-notation","title":"简谱记谱法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/music-theory-foundations/notation-systems/numbered-notation","wordCount":1280,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"简谱记谱法\">简谱记谱法</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>简谱以数字表示音高</strong>：1-7 对应 do-si，用阿拉伯数字取代五线谱的线间位置。</li>\n<li><strong>核心是首调思维</strong>：无论什么调，主音始终记为&quot;1&quot;，调号以&quot;1=C&quot;&quot;1=G&quot;的形式标在开头，极大降低了调号认知负担。</li>\n<li><strong>音高靠加点升降八度</strong>：音符上方加点升八度、下方加点降八度，数字前的 # 或 b 表示半音变化。</li>\n<li><strong>时值靠横线与下划线编码</strong>：音符后加横线延长时值，音符下加下划线缩短时值，0 表示休止。</li>\n<li><strong>优势与局限同样鲜明</strong>：学习门槛低、适合歌唱，但不适合复杂和声与器乐、不表达固定音高。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"简谱的基本原理\">简谱的基本原理</h2><p>简谱（Numbered Musical Notation）是一种以阿拉伯数字表示音高的记谱法，19 世纪由法国人 Jean-Jacques Rousseau 提出雏形，后经改良在中国、日本等东亚国家广泛传播。简谱的核心优势在于<strong>首调思维</strong>——无论什么调，主音始终记为&quot;1&quot;，极大降低了调号认知负担。</p>\n<p>基本音名用 1-7 表示：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mtext>do</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mtext>re</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mtext>mi</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mtext>fa</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mtext>sol</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mtext>la</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mtext>si</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 = \\text{do}, \\quad 2 = \\text{re}, \\quad 3 = \\text{mi}, \\quad 4 = \\text{fa}, \\quad 5 = \\text{sol}, \\quad 6 = \\text{la}, \\quad 7 = \\text{si}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">do</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">re</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8623em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mi</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fa</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sol</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">la</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">si</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>调号标记在乐曲开头，形如&quot;1=C&quot;表示以 C 为 do（即 C 大调），&quot;1=G&quot;表示以 G 为 do（即 G 大调）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 简谱首调原理&#10;        A[&quot;1=C → C大调&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;1234567&lt;br/&gt;= CDEFGAB&quot;]&#10;        C[&quot;1=G → G大调&quot;] --&gt; D[&quot;1234567&lt;br/&gt;= GABCDEF♯&quot;]&#10;        E[&quot;核心:1总是主音&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 简谱首调原理\n        A[\"1=C → C大调\"] --&gt; B[\"1234567&lt;br/&gt;= CDEFGAB\"]\n        C[\"1=G → G大调\"] --&gt; D[\"1234567&lt;br/&gt;= GABCDEF♯\"]\n        E[\"核心:1总是主音\"]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"音高标记规则\">音高标记规则</h2><p><strong>高低八度</strong>：音符上方加点表示升高八度，下方加点表示降低八度。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mo>˙</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mtext>高八度 do</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi><munder><mo><mn>1</mn></mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></munder></mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>低八度 do</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\dot{1} = \\text{高八度 do}, \\quad \\underset{.}{1} = \\text{低八度 do}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8813em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8813em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2134em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1389em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3944em;vertical-align:-0.7em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">高八度</span><span class=\"mord\"> do</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">.</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">低八度</span><span class=\"mord\"> do</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mo>¨</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mtext>高两个八度 do</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ddot{1} = \\text{高两个八度 do}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8813em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8813em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2134em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">¨</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">高两个八度</span><span class=\"mord\"> do</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>升降号</strong>：# 放在数字前表示升半音，b 放在数字前表示降半音。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">#</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mtext>升 fa</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>b</mi><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mtext>降 si</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\#4 = \\text{升 fa}, \\quad b7 = \\text{降 si}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">#4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">升</span><span class=\"mord\"> fa</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">降</span><span class=\"mord\"> si</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>标记</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>五线谱等价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>中音 do</td>\n<td>C4（当 1=C 时）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mo>˙</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\dot{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8813em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8813em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2134em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1389em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>高音 do</td>\n<td>C5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi><munder><mo><mn>1</mn></mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></munder></mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\underset{.}{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3444em;vertical-align:-0.7em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">.</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>低音 do</td>\n<td>C3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>#1</td>\n<td>升 do</td>\n<td>C♯</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>b3</td>\n<td>降 mi</td>\n<td>E♭</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"时值标记系统\">时值标记系统</h2><p>简谱用音符后的横线和下方的下划线来标记时值：</p>\n<p><strong>延长时值</strong>（音符后加横线）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>1 - - -</code> = 全音符（4 拍）</li>\n<li><code>1 - -</code> = 附点二分音符（3 拍）</li>\n<li><code>1 -</code> = 二分音符（2 拍）</li>\n<li><code>1</code> = 四分音符（1 拍）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>缩短时值</strong>（音符下方加下划线）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>一条下划线 = 八分音符（1/2 拍）</li>\n<li>两条下划线 = 十六分音符（1/4 拍）</li>\n<li>三条下划线 = 三十二分音符（1/8 拍）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>附点</strong>：音符后加圆点，延长一半时值。</p>\n<p><strong>休止符</strong>：用 0 表示，时值规则与音符相同。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;简谱时值体系&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;延长方向&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;缩短方向&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;加横线&lt;br/&gt;1- = 2拍&lt;br/&gt;1-- = 3拍&lt;br/&gt;1--- = 4拍&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;加下划线&lt;br/&gt;1条 = 1/2拍&lt;br/&gt;2条 = 1/4拍&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;附点&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[&quot;时值×1.5&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"简谱时值体系\"] --&gt; B[\"延长方向\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"缩短方向\"]\n    B --&gt; B1[\"加横线&lt;br/&gt;1- = 2拍&lt;br/&gt;1-- = 3拍&lt;br/&gt;1--- = 4拍\"]\n    C --&gt; C1[\"加下划线&lt;br/&gt;1条 = 1/2拍&lt;br/&gt;2条 = 1/4拍\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"附点\"]\n    D --&gt; D1[\"时值×1.5\"]</pre><h2 id=\"简谱的优势与局限\">简谱的优势与局限</h2><p><strong>优势</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>学习门槛低——不需要识别线间位置，数字直观</li>\n<li>首调思维——无需记忆复杂调号</li>\n<li>适合歌唱——与唱名法（do-re-mi）天然对应</li>\n<li>书写便捷——手写速度远快于五线谱</li>\n<li>视唱训练友好——直接对应音程关系</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>局限</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>不适合复杂和声——无法便捷标记多声部纵向关系</li>\n<li>不适合器乐——演奏者需要二次转换为具体指法</li>\n<li>不表达固定音高——同一个&quot;1&quot;在不同调号下对应不同键</li>\n<li>节奏符号系统视觉辨识度低——连续快速音符阅读困难</li>\n<li>国际通用性差——专业音乐院校统一使用五线谱</li>\n</ol>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>使用场景</th>\n<th>简谱适用性</th>\n<th>五线谱适用性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>合唱排练</td>\n<td>★★★★★</td>\n<td>★★★</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>流行歌曲记录</td>\n<td>★★★★★</td>\n<td>★★★</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>管弦乐总谱</td>\n<td>★</td>\n<td>★★★★★</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>钢琴独奏</td>\n<td>★★</td>\n<td>★★★★★</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>吉他弹唱</td>\n<td>★★★★</td>\n<td>★★★</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>音乐教育入门</td>\n<td>★★★★★</td>\n<td>★★★</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"简谱在中国音乐实践中的地位\">简谱在中国音乐实践中的地位</h2><p>简谱在中国的普及程度远超其他任何国家。这一现象的历史原因包括：20 世纪初期学堂乐歌运动的推动、群众音乐活动（红歌、革命歌曲）的传播需求，以及中国声乐传统中首调思维的文化土壤。</p>\n<p>在当代中国，简谱仍然是群众音乐活动（合唱团、社区乐团）、流行歌曲传播（KTV、音乐 App 歌词页）以及中小学音乐教育中的主要记谱方式。然而，专业音乐院校的课程全面使用五线谱，简谱被视为过渡性工具。</p>\n<p>数字时代为简谱带来了新的生命力。各类音乐 App（如全民 K 歌、唱吧）在 2024-2025 年的版本更新中普遍支持简谱+滚动歌词的联动显示，降低了用户的视唱门槛。在线简谱编辑器（如 EasyABC 的简谱模式）也在持续完善排版能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>简谱以数字 1-7 表示音高，核心是首调思维——主音始终记为&quot;1&quot;，不随调号改变。</li>\n<li>音高通过上下加点标示八度，数字前的 # / b 表示半音升降。</li>\n<li>时值由音符后的横线（延长）与下方的下划线（缩短）共同编码，0 为休止符。</li>\n<li>简谱学习门槛低、适合歌唱与群众音乐活动，但不适合复杂和声、器乐与固定音高表达。</li>\n<li>简谱在中国音乐实践中地位突出，数字时代借由音乐 App 与在线编辑器获得新的应用场景。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"简谱记谱法","id":"简谱记谱法"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"简谱的基本原理","id":"简谱的基本原理"},{"level":2,"text":"音高标记规则","id":"音高标记规则"},{"level":2,"text":"时值标记系统","id":"时值标记系统"},{"level":2,"text":"简谱的优势与局限","id":"简谱的优势与局限"},{"level":2,"text":"简谱在中国音乐实践中的地位","id":"简谱在中国音乐实践中的地位"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"五线谱系统详解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/music-theory-foundations/notation-systems/staff-notation"},"next":{"title":"吉他谱与数字记谱标准","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/music-theory-foundations/notation-systems/guitar-tab-digital"}}